  heroes  refused: HTML is not XML; a text that is not well-formed is refused, never guessed at
  go      Decoder.Strict, Decoder.AutoClose, HTMLAutoClose, HTMLEntity
  rust    -
  python  HTML_EMPTY, tostring(method="html"), ElementTree.write(method="html")
