capability xml/records  a record filled from XML by its field names, and written as XML
  heroes  refused: needs reflection
  go      Marshal, MarshalIndent, Unmarshal, Decoder.Decode, Decoder.DecodeElement, Encoder.Encode, Encoder.EncodeElement, TagPathError, TagPathError.Error, UnmarshalError, UnmarshalError.Error, UnsupportedTypeError, UnsupportedTypeError.Error
  rust    -
  python  -
  note    the language has no reflection and no tag on a field (design.md Part 6); a program reads each value with the walking functions and builds its own type

