capability xml/tokens  a text read one token at a time, and written one at a time
  heroes  refused: xml stands on no stream
  go      Decoder.Token, Decoder.RawToken, Decoder.Skip, Decoder.InputOffset, CopyToken, TokenReader, NewTokenDecoder, StartElement.End, StartElement.Copy, CharData.Copy, Comment.Copy, ProcInst.Copy, Encoder.EncodeToken
  rust    -
  python  iterparse, XMLPullParser, XMLPullParser.feed, XMLPullParser.read_events, XMLPullParser.close, XMLPullParser.flush, saxutils.XMLGenerator
