capability xml/stream  XML read from a stream and written to one
  heroes  refused: xml stands on no stream
  go      NewDecoder, Decoder, NewEncoder, Encoder, Encoder.Flush, Encoder.Close
  rust    -
  python  parse, ElementTree.parse, ElementTree.write (to a file), minidom.parse, Node.writexml (to a writer)
  note    `xml` may use `strings`, `numbers` and `unicode` and no stream (README A1); a program reads the text with `read_file` or `io` and calls `parse`, and writes what `format` answers

capability xml/up  an element's parent and siblings
  heroes  refused: a value holds no reference to its parent
  go      -
  rust    -
  python  Node.parentNode, Node.nextSibling, Node.previousSibling, Node.ownerDocument, Attr.ownerElement
